            <a class="px-4 py-2.5 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-500 hover:text-[#1B2B22] transition-colors flex items-center gap-2" href="services.html#package-nz"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-stone-400"></span> New Zealand Package</a>
            <a class="px-4 py-2.5 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-500 hover:text-[#1B2B22] transition-colors flex items-center gap-2" href="services.html#package-africa"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-stone-400"></span> African Experience</a>
            <a class="px-4 py-2.5 font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-500 hover:text-[#1B2B22] transition-colors flex items-center gap-2" href="services.html#package-namibia"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-stone-400"></span> Hunting in Namibia</a>
            <div class="pt-4 pb-2 flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] text-stone-400">workspace_premium</span><span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-400 font-sans font-semibold">Dangerous Game Hunting</span></div>
